Package: accelerate-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: pytorch-termux, python-pip, python-psutil, rust, clang, make, pkg-config
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: Accelerate for Termux - CPU-only PyTorch training
 HuggingFace Accelerate for a phone. No CUDA on a phone, so training
 runs on CPU: the upstream `accelerate` auto-detects Android (PyTorch
 accelerator: N/A) and uses CPU. apt installs numpy, torch and the
 Rust toolchain (needed only if safetensors must be compiled); the
 install step pip-installs accelerate. Commands: accelerate-check,
 accelerate-setup, upstream `accelerate`. Set ACCELERATE_SKIP_SETUP=1
 during apt install to skip the setup (run accelerate-setup later).
